    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd121ec798840ed62f2215eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如你所见，虽然我也年事已高，能就任训练员的时间应该也不太长……\r\n但还是请你多多关照了，副训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa625817af71dd2b36e7bf15e937c8e598d4aadcdd2afebed5051212bf8c9cd8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
