      "uid": "zhcn:1c2941be67ea8dbe863ea8e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，目白多伯则是尚未出道的赛马娘。\r\n我原以为她只要能不被气槽甩开太多就好了，然而——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8238dcf1f235efdfb37846d9f7746429ee2ddda35319e6f2c6c421ba55e8bc26",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1059/storytimeline_041059001.json",
      "json_path": [
